      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode remained open at runtime termination, but the family was already in emergency care, had clear instructions to continue NPO, avoid home medications, monitor red flags, and await gastroenterology/serial labs. The remaining uncertainty was under an offline responsible team rather than abandoned.",
