          "explanation": "Later monitoring instructions included decreased urine output as an urgent warning sign.",
          "quote": "尿量明显变少"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly screened and instructed escalation for hematemesis, melena, mental status change, fever/infection-related symptoms, abdominal worsening, cardiopulmonary/thrombotic symptoms, and later urine reduction. Procedure-site symptoms were not relevant after the family pathway clarified an uncompleted/awaiting intervention context.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
