          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished the immediate suspected-bleeding pathway from the angiography/stent issue.",
          "quote": "造影支架那件事，今晚彻底放下"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified the appropriate procedural follow-up pathway for angiography/stent evaluation.",
          "quote": "介入血管外科/布加综合征诊治经验"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The current setting moved from home to emergency care, and the doctor adjusted the plan to ED stabilization before later interventional follow-up. The procedure state was not perfectly documented by the doctor at the start, but family statements that follow-up was not yet scheduled and subsequent ED instructions made the actionable state sufficiently clear.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
