          "explanation": "The doctor recognized the combined disease structure rather than treating it as isolated vessel narrowing.",
          "quote": "布加综合征、肝硬化和食管静脉曲张"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00103",
          "explanation": "The doctor tied black stool risk to cirrhosis plus varices.",
          "quote": "在肝硬化+食管胃底静脉曲张这个背景下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor communicated the near-term risk structure of variceal bleeding and decompensation alongside Budd-Chiari/IVC disease and prioritized bleeding risk over elective stent discussion when melena became plausible.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
