      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00009",
          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to retrieve decision-critical records including viral markers through the workspace.",
          "quote": "HBV/HCV等病毒学标志物"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00173",
          "explanation": "The doctor integrated patient-read laboratory values into risk assessment.",
          "quote": "HGB 92 g/L、PLT 58×10⁹/L、INR 1.55"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor pursued records and key labs/medications, acknowledged uncertainty, and used the family's read-back values. Viral testing was queried internally but not meaningfully resolved with the family; in the acute ED-shifted episode this did not break immediate safety enough to mark an RC error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided several conservative medication and diet safety boundaries.",
          "quote": "绝对不要喝酒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00103",
          "explanation": "During suspected bleeding, the doctor instructed not to independently add or stop medicines and to bring the medication bag.",
          "quote": "手里的药不要自己加、不要自己停"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Medication, alcohol, supplement, and diet cautions were present, and later NPO/home-medication boundaries were appropriate for suspected bleeding. However, the authored duty specifically required maintaining smooth bowel movements and avoiding forceful straining because of variceal bleeding risk; that bowel/straining precaution was not given in the home safety plan.",
